<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">1 Yohans</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Yohans</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Yohans Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt">Wosheetso Yohans Shints Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshetso Yohans shino b́ woshts wosho keewi een een git asaabiyotsi biitse detsfe. Bowere han nababituwots Ik'onat Naayo Iyesus Krstosnton ik woto bo detsetwok'o boon kup'iyonat ik wotmanowere t'afiy falitu kootetsuwots bo danirudnatse boatso bokotetuwok'oshe. Manoori tuuts kootets kooti dani gondo t'uup't keshiruwatse be'eyiru datsanton k'aleyiru gonkeyo b́wottsotse, Ik'o naay Iyesus b́jamon ashwoto wee ash nai amalo detso falratse etiiruwoni b́teshi. Daniru manots «Wora eto datsatsi beyosh kic'otse nas' kesha eta» boetfooni b́teshi. Mantonuwere «Sheeng amal detso wotowa ash k'oshosh shun kitso woronton eegor gonkewo» deshatse eta boetfo boteshi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Han Guut'tso danan k'efat Iyesus Krstos ari ashe, Iyesusi amaniruwotsnat Ik' shuniru jamwotsn boatsatseyosh shunewo boosh geyife ett keewure.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Shaanonat t'aluwona 1:5—2:29</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik'i nanaúwotsnat Diyablos nana'otsn 3:1-24</para>
  <para style="io1">Aroonat sheelon 4:1-6</para>
  <para style="io1">Shuno b́k'alit k'alo 4:7-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Da'ts imnetiyo 5:1-21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kash aap'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>Shin teshts kashi aap'i jango itsh guut'irwonee, kashi aap'anuwere no shishtsonat no aawon nobek'tso, nos'iiltsonat nokishonowere noshu'utsoniye. <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/>Kashanwere be'ere noowere bín bek'rone, no b́ jangosh gawitwone. Nihoke teshtsonat noosh be'ets dúre dúri kasho itsh keewitwone. <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Noonton ik woto itdetseetwek'o nobek'tsok'onat noshishtson itsh keewirwone. Ik nowotitwere nihonat b́ naay Iyesus Krstosntoniye. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>Nogeneeúwo s'een b́wototiwok'o han itsh guut'irwone.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o sháán b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Bíyokee noshishtsonat itsh nokewit wosho «Ik'o shááne, t'aluwonwere b́jamon bíyoke aaliye» etiruwoniye. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Mansh «Ik'onton ik woto detsfone» erfetsr t'aluwotse nobeetka wotiyal koote nokotiri, no aap'onat nofino arikaliye etee. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Wotowa eree bí sháánotse b́ beyirwok'o noowere sháánotse nobeyink'e no atsatsewo ik wotosh faliyank'one. Dab b́ naay Iyesus Krstos s'atsonwor morr jamotse noon s'aytsitwee.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Morro deshatsone no'etal notooke no ant'elciri, aronwere noytse aaliye. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>No morro Ik'osh kish nokewitka wotiyal bí kááwonat amanek b́wottsosh nomorr jamo noosh orowa eteetwe nogond fin jamatsno noon s'ayintsitwe. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Morro fineratsone no'etetkawotiyal Ik'one kotetsiye nowoshiri, bí aap'onwere noyitse aali etee.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Krstos noosh ned'tso b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>T nana'otso! han itsh tguut'ir morro itfinerawok'owa etaatniye. Wotowa eree konunoru b́ wotiyal asho morro b́finiyal nihokere noosh ned'itwo detsfone, bíwere kááwo Iyesus Krstosiye. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Bí nomorro t'afibazetwe, nomorr mec'rosh b́woterawon dats jami morro t'afibazetwo bíne.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Ik'i tzaziya no s'eentsiri wotiyal bín dank nowottsok'o manne nokitsiti. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>«Ik'o danfee» et fetst b́ tzaziyotsi s'eentsrawo fa'e wotiyal kootetskee, arikeewonwere b́gitsotse aaliye. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Ernmó Ik'i aap'osh aleyiru jamo Ik'osh b́ detsts shuno arikee, arikon bín beyirwotsi nowottsok'owo b́ danet manne, <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Ik'ontoniye tbeyiri etiru asho Krstos beyiruwok'o beyo bísh geyife.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Handr tzaziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>T shuntswotso! itsh t guut'iru tzaziyan shin shinon it detsts yotstsuniye bako handriyaliye, yoots tzaziyanwere it shihsts aap'oniye. <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Wotowa eree Krstosnat itoke ar wotat be'etso handr tzaziyoniye itsh tguut'iri, t'aluwo k'aaú b́bazere ari shááno and sháánirwe.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>Sháánatse beyiruwe etfetst bí'eshuwi shit'irwo andoor t'aluwotse b́ fa'oni. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Bí eshwi shuniru jamo sháánatse b́beyiri, bíyoknowere ashosh t'ug wotit keewo daatseratse. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Bí eshuwi shit'irwonmó t'aluwotsene b́beyiri, t'aluwotsnowere bíananiri, t'aluwonwere bíaawo dek b́k'rtsotse bíamirwoko dande'atse.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>T nana'úwotso! it morro Iyesus shúútson itsh orowe etetsotsne itsh t guut'iri. <verse eid="1JN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Nih nihuwotso! shintson beyirwo itdantsotsene itsh guut'irwe. Jawetswotsnat baaruwotso! shed'ano it da'atsotsne itsh t guut'iri. <verse eid="1JN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Nana'úwotso! Niho itdantsotsene itsh t guut'iriye, nihuwotso, shin shino teshtso it dantsotsne itsh tguut'iye. Jawetsonat baaruwotso! kup'uwotsi it wottswotsnat Ik'i aap'o it nibotse b́beyrwotse, shed'anonowere itda'atsotse itsh guut're.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Datsani wotowa datsank wotts keew jamo shunk'ayere. Datsani shunetwo Ik'o niho shuno bíatsotse aaliye. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Datsuatse beyru jamo meets tewuno, ááw mirac'o, b́ beewon it'o datsatsika bako Ik'o nihokikaliye. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Datsannat b́ tewunonowere beshitke. Ernmó Ik' shuntsok'o k'alituwo dúre dúroshe b́ beeti.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstosi k'efirwotsatse ni atso korde'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>T nana'otso! hań s'uwaatsi sa'atoniye, «Krstosi k'efitwo weetwe» eteere shishrte, hamb, dab́ andoor Krstosi k'efiru aywots tuurnee, manatse tuutson s'uwaatsi sa'at b́woto manne nodaniye. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>Bo noyitsne bokeshi. Wotowa eree yotsor nojirnaliye, nojirno wotink'ere noonton kup'arniye bobeyank'oni. Ernmó boúnetswor nojir wotbok'azo b́danetwok'o noyitse galeyat k'azkeshrnee.<verse eid="1JN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Itnmó S'ayin shayiron Krstos fuutk'rere. Mansh it jamets ún keewo danfte. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Itsh t guut'ir ariko itdartsoshaliye, itiyere aro danfte, arotsnowere kooto b́datserawok'o danfte.<verse eid="1JN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>Eshe Iyesus Krstosi b́ wottsok'osh haalirwoniyere okoon kone kotetsoni? Bí Krstosi k'efirwoniye, Nihonat naayo noowere haalitwe. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Naayo halitwonu nihonowere de'atse, na'on amantso nihono amanere.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Shin shintson it shishts keewman it nibotse s'ap'de'er beewe, itmó shin shintson it shishtsman it nibotse s'ap'de'er b́ betka wotiyal na'onat nihonton ik woto detsetute. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Manwere Krstos shinomaants noosh jangit b́imetso dúre dúr kashoniye.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Itn dariyiru ashuwotsatse tuutsone han t guut'i, <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Krstosoke itdek'ts shayiri S'ayno ititse b́ beyrwosh k'oshodanitwo itsh geyiratse, bíwere jam keewo itsh danituwe, itsh b́ danitwonu ara bako kootaliye mansh shayiri S'ayno itn b́ danitsok'on Krstoston wotde'er beewere,.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Eshe t nana'otso! bí b́be'ewor nosharaniyere aawo shu'úde'er bín nobek'etwok'onat bí b́weet aawots b́ shinatse nojitserawok'o bíń beewere,, <verse eid="1JN 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Bíwere kááwo b́wotok'o it daniyakon, kááw finiru jamo Ik'oke shuwek b́ wottsok'o dande'ere.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' nana'úwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>Ik' nana'uwotsi erŕ nos'eegeetwok'o niho awuk'o shuno noosh b́imtsok'o aab́ s'iilere! arikon noowere Ik' nana'a noone, datsan Ik'o b́dartsosh nonowere danatse. <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>T shuntswotso! and no Ik' nana'a noone, shinomaantsish eeg nowotitwok'o daneerafa'ee, ernmó Krstos b́be'et aawots bí aro arikon eeg bíarok'o nobek'etwotse bínowere noaritwok'ó danfone. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Krstosn man b́ wotitwok'o jangiru jamo Krstos s'ayn b́ wottsok'o bíwere b́ tooko s'ayn woshituwe.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Morra eto Ik' nemo gaak b́ wottsotse morr finit jamo Ik' nemo gáákre. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/>Ashuwots morro t'afiyosh Krstos b́be'etsok'onat bíwere morro b́ deshawok'o danfte. <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Eshe Krstosnton beet ash jamo morro fineratse. Morr finitu asho Krstosi be'atse, bínowere danatse.<verse eid="1JN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>T nana'uwotso! konworu itn bí ant'elcerawok'owa, Krstos kááwo b́ wottsok'o kááwts fino k'alitu jamo kááwe. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Diyablos shintson dek'tut morro b́ finirwosh morr finiru ash jamo Diyablos jiire. Ik' na'o b́ be'e diyablos fino gakoshee.<verse eid="1JN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Ik'i doyo b́gitsotse b́beyirwotsnat Ik'atse b́shuwetsotse Ik'i na'a wottso morro fineratse, finoshowere falratse. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Ik' nana'onat Diyablos nana'on galde danet hanne, Kááw finerawonat bí eshuwi shunaw jamonúwots Ik' nana'analiye.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atsatsewo shuneyi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>Shin shintson it k'ebts wosho «No atsatsewo shunewone» etirwoniye. <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/>Shed'ani jir teshtsonat bíeshuwi úd'tso K'ayelkok'o woto geyiratse, bí bíeshuwi eegishe b́ úd'i? B́ fino gond b́ teshtsotsnat bí eshu fino kááw b́ teshtsotsne.<verse eid="1JN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Ti eshuwotso! datsatsi ashuwots iti boshit'al mansh adk'ayere. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/>Noo no eshuwotsi noshunirwotse k'iromaantse kashomaants k'az nokimtsok'o danfone. Shun deshaw asho k'iri c'ishotse b́beyri. <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Bíeshuwi shit'iru jamo kash úd'kee, kash úd'tsonmó dúredúri kasho b́daatsrawok'o danfte. <verse eid="1JN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Shuno eeg b́wottsok'o nodanet Iyesus Krstos b́ kasho noosh b́imtsoshe, noowere nokasho no eshuwotssh beshide imo noosh geyife. <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Datsanatse gaalo deshfetsr kic'iru asho be'efetsr maac' k'eweraw asho «Ik'o shunfee» eto awuk'o k'alrniya b́faliti? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>T nana'otso! No shuno arikonat finon be'etka bako noonon mec'ron keewon wotk'aye.<verse eid="1JN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i shinatse nodetsts ááwu shuuk'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Mannowere arkeewtswotsi nowottsok'onat Ik'ishinats t'inosh shatalon aaw shuk'on t'inosh nofalitwok'o danfone. <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>Nonibo noats bíangshiyalor Ik'o noniboniyere danbe, bíye jamkeewo danfee. <verse eid="1JN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>T shuntswotso! No nibo noats angshratse wotiyal Ik'i shinatse ááw shuuk'o detsetwonee. <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>Ik'i tzazi jamo s'eentsr bín gene'úshit keewo nofinitwotse nok'onitu jamo bíyoke daatsitwone. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/>Ik'o azaztsonu b́ naay Iyesus Krstos shútson amanar Krstos noon bíazaztsok'on noatsatsewo noshunetwok'owe. <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Ik'o azaztso k'alitu jamwots Ik'ona bobeti, Ik'onwere boyitse b́beeti, Ik'o noyitse b́beyirwok'o nodanet noosh b́ imts S'ayin shayirone.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ari shayironat kooti shayiron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>T shuntswotso! datsatse kotetsk wotts nebiyiwots botutsotse shayr jamwotsi aman k'ayere, maniyere shayirwots Ik'okik bowotonat wotbok'azo fads'iilere. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Ik' Shayiro b́ woto galde'e it danet hanne Iyesus Krstos meetson b́ be'etsok'o amants shayir jamo Ik'i shayire, <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>Iyesus Krstos ash wotat meetso tahadek't b́be'etsok'o amaneraw shayir jamo Ik'oki shayiraliye, shayiraanu weetwe etefere itshishtso Krstosi k'efiru shayironiye, bíwere andoru dab́ datsuatse fa'ee.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Nana'otso! It Ik'k itne, ititse beyru shayiro datsanatse fa'a shayironiyere bogfe. Eshe kotets nebiyotsi da'artee. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Kootets nebiyots datsatsikne, bokeewirwonu datsanatsi keewoniye. Datsanwere bokeewo k'ebetwane. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>No Ik'ik noone, Ik' dants jamo no keewo k'ebetwe, Ik'ik woteraw jamonmó no keewo k'ewatse. Ari shayronat kooti shayiron nodanet hanne.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o shune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>Shunetswotsó! shuno Ik'okik b́wottsotse no atsatsewo shunewone, shuniru jamo Ik'i na'ee, Ik'onowere danfee. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Ik'o shun b́wottsotse ash shunaw jamo Ik'o danatse. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Ik'o b́naayn kasho nodaatsitwok'o b́ naay ik s'uzo datsanats woshere, mannowere Ik'i shuno nodagotse be'ere. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Shuna eto hank'oyiye, no Ik'o noshuntsosh b́ woterawo bí noon b́ shuntsonat nomorro b́ t'afitwok'o b́ naayi b́woshtsoshee.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>Shunetswotsó! Ik'o hank'o noon b́shuniyakon no noatsatsewo shunewo noon geyife. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/>Ik' bek'ts asho konwor aaliye. Noo noatsatsewo noshuneyink'ere Ik'o noyitse beyank'ee, b́ shunonwere noyitse s'een wotiyank'ee.<verse eid="1JN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Ik'o b́ shayiro nooshowere b́'imtsotse no bín bíwere noyitse b́ beyirwok'owo danfone. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Niho datsani b́ kashitwok'o woshdek't naayo b́wooshtsok'o bek'rone, manowere gawitwone. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Iyesus Ik'o naayi b́ wottsok'o amanitu ashotsne Ik'o b́beeti, bíwere Ik'ootse b́beeti. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Mann Ik'o noosh b́detsts shuno danfone, manowere amanerone. Ik'o shune, shunon beyirwo Ik'one b́beyiri, Ik'onwere b́ gitsotse b́beyiri. <verse eid="1JN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Noo datsanatse nobeyir ari Krstos b́beyirwok'o b́wottsotse noshuno s'een b́wotink'ere angshi aawots shatalon b́shinaatse aaw shuk'on t'inosh falyank'onee. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>S'een shuno shato kishde'erni juubk'rti bako shunotse shato aaliye, shato sezonton deshk b́wottsotse shatiru asho b́shuno s'een woteratse.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Ik'o shin shintson nonb́shuntsotse noowere shunetwonee. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Ik'o shunfee etfetst bíeshuwi shit'irwo kotetsiye, b́ bek'tso bí'eshuwi shunatse wotiyal b́ be'aaw Ik'o shuno falratse. <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Eshe Krstos noosh b́'imts tzaziyo Ik' shuntso bíeshuno shune erkee.<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Datsu imnetiyon da'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Iyesus Mesihiyo b́ wottsok'o amants jamwots Ik' nana'anee, nihono shunetu jamo naayo noowere shunfee. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Ik' nana'úwotsi noshuntsok'o nodanetiye, Ik'o shunr b́ tzaziyo no s'entsoree. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/>Ik' shuna eto b́ tzaziyotsi s'entsee. B́ tzaziyotsu mangnaliye. <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>Ik' nana'a wotts jamo datsu da'itwe, datsu no da'itwere imnetiyone. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Iyesus Ik'o naayi b́ wottsok'o amantsoni bako kone datsu da'itwoni?<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos jangosh gawets gawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Aatsots b́ gupetsok'o kitsit aatsonat b́ k'iro kitsru s'atsi weeron waatso Iyesus Krstosiye. Bí b́waa aats mec'ron b́ woterawo aatsonat s'atsone. Hanwere ar b́ wottsotse, keewanwere ar b́wottsok'owo S'ayin shayiron gawitwe. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Keez gawwots fa'ane, <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>Bowere Shayirona, aatsonat s'atsone, keezanotswere bogawon ikne. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Ashuwots bo gawts gawo dek'etwonee, ernmó Ik'o gawts gawonmó jamoniyere bogfe. Ik'o b́ gawtsonwere b́ naay jangosh b́ gawtsoniyee haniye. <verse eid="1JN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Ik'o naayn amantsonmó gawan b́ gitsotse fa'ee, Ik' amanerawonmó Ik'o b́ naay jangosh b́'imts gawo aman b́ k'aztsatse tuutson Ik'o kootetsi woshre. <verse eid="1JN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/>B́ gawonwere Ik'o dúre dúri kasho noosh b́ imtsok'onat kashmanwere b́ naayitse b́ beyirwok'o gawirwoniyee. <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Ik'o naayi detstso kasho detsfe. Ik'o naayi deshawonmó kasho deshatse.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dúre dúri kasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>It Ik'o naay shútson amants jamwots dúre dúri kasho it detstsok'o it danishe han itsh guut're. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Kon naari keewonor b́ wotiyal b́ shuntsok'on nok'onitkawotiyal noosh b́ shishetwok'o amanitwone. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Noo k'onts jamo b́ shishetwok'o danfonewotiyal, bíyokere nok'onts jamo andon nodek'etwok'o danfone.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Konworu wotowa, ash iko bí eshu k'irosh bín betsaw morro b́ finefe b́bek'al bísh Ik'o k'onwe, ashman morro k'irosh bín betsatse wotiyal Ik'o kasho bísh imetwe. Ernmó k'irosh betsit morro fa'ee. Man naari morrosh Ik'o k'onuwe eraatse taa. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Gond fin jamo morre. Wotowa eree k'irosh betsraw morro fa'ee.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Ik' na'o Iyesus Krstos bín b́ kotirwosh Ik' na'a wotts jamo morro b́ finerawok'o danfone, Shed'anonwere bíats boratse.<verse eid="1JN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Noo Ik'k nowottsok'o danfone. Datsunmó jamon shed'ani ali shirotse b́ fa'oni.<verse eid="1JN 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Ik' na'o b́ wattsok'onat ari Ik'o nodanetwok'o t'iwitsts nibo noosh b́'imtsok'o danfone, b́ naay Iyesus Krstos weeron bínton ari Ik'onton ikwoto detsfone. Iyesus Krstos ari Izar Izeweru dúre dúri kashonu bíne.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>T nana'otso! dozets ik'wotsatse it atso korde'ere.<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
